{
  "case_id": "BUG3-MIXIN-BADGE-1.21.1",
  "title": "bug3 效果计数器 mixin 应被加载(物品栏效果角标改阿拉伯数字)",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "bugfix",
    "ref": "bug3"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "步骤1 基线清零(幂等:不依赖前一条用例留下的残量),再制造两个「可辨识角标」的计数:充能 20 层(上限;原版会显示罗马数字 XX)、赋能 5 层(原版 V)"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe empowerclear B3"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe charge 20 B3"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe empower 5 B3"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe status B3"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "步骤2 角标是客户端渲染行为:效力由 debug.log 的 Mixing 应用行 + Mixin 失败检测共同判定;计数值由 latest.log 的 AP 标记核验(且 ≥10,罗马数字无法表达)"
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "debug",
      "pattern": "Mixing .* from astral_dice\\.mixins\\.json into"
    },
    {
      "type": "mixin"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_CHARGE:20"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_EMPOWER:5:6\\d\\d"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_ERR|AP_B3_EX"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running"
}
